{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-04-09T08:10:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T15:50:48Z","closed_at":"2025-04-22T15:46:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nAll versions with GridMap.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nGridMap `Octant`s that exists to partition the GridMap into update chunks are something but not actual octants.\n\nI tried to visualize the octants and use them for queries and they are totally broken. There rasterization is all over the place.\n\nWith a default `octant_size` of 8 some octants have a width of up to 17 cells, while some octants only have 7 cells, some are inbetween with 15, some octants and cell keys bleed to neighbors, some dont ... it is all \"random\" because the remap from world position to GridMap cell key or OctantKey is wrong. It runs into problems with int / int div and signed numbers as well as rounding errors. The GridMaps own 16 bit float position limit adds insult to injury the moment you move a little further away from the world origin.\n\nSince this is all \"hidden\" GridMap internal I am not surprised that no one ever noticed how broken the octant partitioning is. \n\nThe only reason why the cell placement even worked is because it does its own cellkey remap.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a custom build and visualize GridMap `Octant`s or try rasterizing cells and positions to `OctantKey`.\n\nSee how the rasterization is wrong by either printing the keys or looking at the entries in the `octant_map` and `cell_map` that the Gridmap adds.\n\n### How to fix?\n\nFix the cell and octant remap functions and keys.\n\nE.g. do what most other raster functions in Godot do and use a float / float div that floors so you actually remap a Vector3 position to its octant cell and not something randomly. Do it only once, not multiple times, else you bleed to neighbor. Or if sure that there will always only be int do some black int magic like tilemap does to deal with signed values.\n\nAlso 1999 called and wants its 16 bit position limit back.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nYou need a custom build as the GridMap `Octant` and `OctantKey` is not public.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105179/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}